OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 3 APR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: The Lives of Hildegard
OL,5,     Fof Bingen
OL,6,     GMedieval composer and polymath
OL,7,     GHildegard of Bingen has one last
OL,8,     Gbattle to fight. A fictionalised
OL,9,     Gaccount, written by Anna Linstrum
OL,10,     Gand performed by Juliet Stevenson.
OL,11,G2200FLate Junction
OL,12,     GEncounter adventurous music from
OL,13,     Garound the globe as Verity Sharp
OL,14,     Gdives into music inspired by
OL,15,     Gwater and explores liberation
OL,16,     Gmusic with its feet in past,
OL,17,     Gpresent and future.
OL,18,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,19,     GTonight's Friday night special
OL,20,     Gfeatures live session highlights
OL,21,     Gfrom jazz saxophonist and
OL,22,     Gcomposer Emma Rawicz.
